<title>USA: United States Exploration buys oil, gas production.</title>
<headline>United States Exploration buys oil, gas production.</headline>
<dateline>INDEPENDENCE, Kan. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>United States Exploration Inc said Tuesday it bought 100-percent working interest in 150 barrels per day equivalent of oil and gas production, effective November 1, 1996.</p>
<p>United States Exploration said it paid an affiliate of the company's president $1.5 million for properties in Logan, Noble and Osage Counties in Oklahoma. The company said the properties contain about 900 lease acres.</p>
<p>The company develops and produces oil and natural gas reserves.</p>
<p>Its shares closed down 4/16 Tuesday at 4-3/16.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
